---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<div class="notice" role="note">
  <Icon name="triangle-alert" size={20} />
  <p><strong>This is not an emergency service.</strong> Messages are read by our team as soon as they can, but not immediately. If you or someone else is in immediate danger, call <a href="tel:999">999</a>. For urgent mental health support, call NHS <a href="tel:111">111</a> (option 2) or Samaritans free on <a href="tel:116123">116 123</a>, any time.</p>
</div>
